				<a href="#contacto" class="block py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white/70 hover:text-cyan-400 border-b border-white/5">Contacto</a>
				<a href="/" class="block py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-400">Ir a Home Clásico</a>
			</div>
		</header>

		<main>
